# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
# NN MARKET RWANDA
## Independent N-Nutrition Product Marketing, Customer Requests & Referral Platform

You are acting as a senior full-stack software engineer, software architect, UX/UI designer, conversion optimization specialist, SEO/AEO strategist and database engineer.

Your assignment is to design and build a complete, production-ready website called **NN Market Rwanda**.

Do not build just a landing page or visual prototype. Build a complete, functional platform with a public-facing website, database, secure admin dashboard, product management, customer request management, referral application management and all necessary backend functionality.

The platform must be easy to understand and operate, particularly for people who:
- Have limited technical knowledge.
- Have limited English fluency.
- Are using smartphones.
- Have slow internet connections.
- Prefer simple instructions and short forms.

The ultimate objective is to make discovering products, requesting products and understanding the N-Nutrition joining process extremely easy.

